{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/441563-ooc-mummy-the-curse-the-washingtonians-chronicle","id":441563,"title":"[OoC] Mummy the Curse: The Washingtonians Chronicle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-14T10:42:33-07:00","id":441563,"title":"[OoC] Mummy the Curse: The Washingtonians Chronicle","content":"You can post your character sheets and discuss concepts here. If you need help making a character don't be afraid to ask for advice.<br /> <br /> Storyteller:<br /> RisTigger<br /> <br /> (Mostly) Confirmed Players:<br /> Blind Dragon<br /> Okami<br /> Kleptomania<br /> AkatsukiLeader13<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/410-ristigger","name":"RisTigger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar410_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T13:35:40-07:00","id":441793,"title":"","content":"Is there any specific format we're going for here or is it just make-it-in-a-word-doc?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T08:03:16-07:00","id":444280,"title":"","content":"My apologies for the delay. I should have a preliminary sheet here tonight or tomorrow at the latest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/480-blind-dragon","name":"Blind Dragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T08:19:09-07:00","id":444292,"title":"","content":"Been a bit delayed myself. I have a test tomorrow morning so I won't have a sheet up until tomorrow night at the earliest.<br /> <br /> Is there anything particularly special about the group or the setting we should know about?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T19:28:03-07:00","id":445224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Okami</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/441563-ooc-mummy-the-curse-the-washingtonians-chronicle?p=441793#post441793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there any specific format we're going for here or is it just make-it-in-a-word-doc?</div> </div> </div> </div>The easiest thing would be to copy paste your sheet in this thread. If you want to just send me your sheet, message me or you can somehow post it in the thread some other way.<br /> <br /> As for the setting. Like we established before, this chronicle is set in Washington D.C. Because this is mummy, keeping things ambiguous is part of the game. I will tell you we are starting in the 21st century. Specifically 2010, two years before the next Sothis rise. The city is in a state of flux, things are changing and shifting creating a power imbalance in the city. You are all caught in the middle of clashing ideals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/410-ristigger","name":"RisTigger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar410_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T20:06:24-07:00","id":445263,"title":"","content":"Awesome, I should have a sheet up sometime within the next couple days.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T02:30:59-07:00","id":447427,"title":"","content":"I'm still working in my character sheet. I've got a lot of it down and am figuring out how to spend my starting experience. How is everyone else doing?<br /> <br /> Oh, and I also need a name. I might actually end up going with a title, say she forgot her original name if possible, makes it easier.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":203,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","user":"Kleptomania","date":". 03-18-2015, 07:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T07:43:19-07:00","id":447668,"title":"","content":"The names are really really hard, I dont have one down yet. My character though is a tef-ahbi who I see as slightly disillusioned with his overall purpose, so for some descents now he's been trying to rebuild his memory. Its not helping that he forgets most of what he's doing every time. I also see him as unusually active for a mummy, he has his cult wake him for a defined list of emergencies and other than that every century. As a builder it drives him nuts being unable to be continually working. Of course he doesnt realize this schedule is actually more of a recent habit after certain events, and that this time his cult missed the mark again due to other recent events. While if it does seem apparent one of his cult members is directly at fault he'll punish them brutally (he is a mummy after all) he'll also secretly be reevaluating how he runs things, or the elements that failed. He designed his cult after all, he taught them how they should run themselves, if his design was meant to last then there shouldnt have been a failure. This means not only the hands but the vision must have been flawed. By the by he also has a lot of investment in his cult. It currently operates as a company that just moved its headquarters to D.C. and specializes in internet infrastructure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T10:17:03-07:00","id":447898,"title":"","content":"I'm halfway done with the sheet. I did choose a name, but it's a placeholder still. I wish there a list or something of Iremite names to pick and choose from.<br /> <br /> About cults, will we be sharing? My Sesha-Hebsu is a cross between an academic and an investigator, so I was thinking the cult would be a secret society in a local university. Something like the Skull and Bones, only much more low-key. But it's just an idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/480-blind-dragon","name":"Blind Dragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T12:54:23-07:00","id":448088,"title":"","content":"This might help with the names.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://fantasynamegenerators.com/egyptian-names.php#.VQnXzjHF_lc\" target=\"_blank\">http://fantasynamegenerators.com/egy...p#.VQnXzjHF_lc</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/410-ristigger","name":"RisTigger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar410_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T16:29:24-07:00","id":448453,"title":"","content":"I dont see why we should share one big cult, it'll be interesting to see how each of ours responds to other ancient *insert divine story cooked up by your mummy here* things like theirs, whose obviously better than all those others, duh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T23:20:49-07:00","id":448882,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blind Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/441563-ooc-mummy-the-curse-the-washingtonians-chronicle?p=447898#post447898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About cults, will we be sharing? My Sesha-Hebsu is a cross between an academic and an investigator, so I was thinking the cult would be a secret society in a local university. Something like the Skull and Bones, only much more low-key. But it's just an idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Might I suggest you operate out of John Hopkins University or the Martin Luther King Jr Memorial Library? Both would be good places to hide for a sesha-hebsu.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/410-ristigger","name":"RisTigger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar410_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T11:46:15-07:00","id":449530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RisTigger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/441563-ooc-mummy-the-curse-the-washingtonians-chronicle?p=448882#post448882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Might I suggest you operate out of John Hopkins University or the Martin Luther King Jr Memorial Library? Both would be good places to hide for a sesha-hebsu.</div> </div> </div> </div>Johns Hopkins sounds perfect. Let's go with that.<br /> <br /> And I'm for having our separate cults, especially if we're from separate guilds. I don't imagine my Mummy's cult would be very big, but it might be different for others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/480-blind-dragon","name":"Blind Dragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T19:33:05-07:00","id":452220,"title":"","content":"Wow, sorry for not being too active guys. Got done with a portfolio friday so I should have some stuff up by the end of the weekend.","signature":"","edited":{"use